  </section>

  <CtaPanel id="cta" heading="Ready to Become ADA Compliant?" deck="Stop guessing — get a professional WCAG 2.2 audit with a clear, actionable remediation roadmap. Our IAAP-certified team finds every violation, not just the 30–40% that automated tools detect.">
